The Development environment enables fast experimentation and repeatable training workflows for vision-based ML models using SageMaker, MLflow, GitHub, ECR, and S3. 

Develop models using SageMaker Studio notebooks with user profiles for isolation
Commit code and pipeline definitions to GitHub.
Use Github actions for CI/CD
S3 as the storage and data versioning tool for training and evaluation data.
