2) Staging / Production Account
2.1) Summary
The Production environment enables secure, governed deployment and operation of approved vision-based ML models using SageMaker, MLflow, GitHub Actions, ECR, S3, and CVAT. The environment is optimized for stability, auditability, and automated deployment of validated model versions.

Deploy approved model versions and pipelines using GitHub Actions-based CI/CD
Separate VPCs for model retraining and model inference workloads
Data is uploaded from factory to input S3 folder
Manage Docker images for training/inference jobs in ECR with strict governance
Retraining pipeline does NOT auto-deploy to production in this version
Execute inference pipelines in separate VPC with event-driven triggers based on data upload from factory
CVAT annotation tool deployed on ECS for annotators to annotate data which will be used for retraining
Restricted data scientist access limited to MLflow metrics, CloudWatch metrics, and CloudWatch logs
Securely store and use secrets
Not in scope

AWS Private link and Gateways for S3, ECR, Lambda etc for integration with SageMaker
Data copy architecture as it's a CTO ticket-based process.
