Model Retraining Pipeline 
Key Principle: Retraining pipeline does NOT deploy models to production inference

A typical SageMaker retraining pipeline includes:

Run with fixed hyper parameter
Evaluation step (metrics logged to MLflow)
Model registration step (to MLflow as "candidate" or "retrained" model)
Manual approval required before model can be promoted to production inference
Pipeline Trigger:

Scheduled (e.g., new data arrival) via EventBridge
Manual trigger via GitHub Actions
VPC Configuration:

Isolated retraining VPC with private subnets
Security groups restricting traffic
Flow logs enabled
